
---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Saltik Research"
  description="Learn about Saltik Research, its approach to independent security research, technical analysis and documentation."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-24 pt-16 sm:pt-24">
    <a
      href="/"
      class="text-sm text-slate-400 transition hover:text-blue-300"
    >
      ← Home
    </a>

    <header class="mt-12 max-w-4xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">About This Research Space</p>

      <h1 class="hero-title mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
        Curiosity into <span class="hero-gradient">knowledge.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-400 sm:text-lg">
        Saltik Research is an independent space for cybersecurity research,
        technical exploration and documented learning.
        The goal is to turn complex technical topics into clear,
        reproducible and useful knowledge.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-5 lg:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr]">
      <article class="glass-card p-7 sm:p-9">
        <p class="card-index">01 / PURPOSE</p>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
          Research with intention.
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm leading-8 text-slate-400 sm:text-base">
          <p>
            Security is more than identifying vulnerabilities.
            It requires understanding systems, examining evidence,
            questioning assumptions and communicating findings clearly.
          </p>

          <p>
            This space documents that process through technical articles,
            CTF write-ups, practical guides and security experiments.
            Each publication aims to explain not only what works,
            but also why it works and what can be learned from it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="glass-card p-7 sm:p-9">
        <p class="card-index">02 / PRINCIPLES</p>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
          How I approach learning.
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-7 space-y-6">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-blue-300">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium text-white">Investigate</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
                Examine the details, gather evidence and understand the context.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-blue-300">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium text-white">Validate</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
                Test assumptions and verify findings in controlled environments.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-blue-300">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium text-white">Document</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
                Share the process, limitations and lessons learned clearly.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-6 glass-card p-7 sm:p-9">
      <p class="card-index">03 / AREAS OF INTEREST</p>

      <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
        Exploring the technical details.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400 sm:text-base">
        The research scope includes defensive security, digital forensics,
        system and network security, security tooling, CTF challenges
        and practical infrastructure analysis.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[
          "Cybersecurity",
          "Digital Forensics",
          "Network Security",
          "Security Tooling",
          "CTF Research",
          "Infrastructure",
        ].map((item) => (
          <span class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
            {item}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-blue-400/15 bg-blue-500/[0.04] p-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:p-9">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-blue-300">
          EXPLORE. ANALYZE. DOCUMENT.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">
          Follow the research.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">
          Explore published articles and follow ongoing technical work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/research/"
          class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-200 transition hover:border-blue-400/40 hover:text-white"
        >
          Browse research
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/cagrisaltik"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-lg bg-blue-500 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-blue-400"
        >
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
